nt", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Route Table B", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Route Table B", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 45164, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 81694, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "11cba4a1457c0235", "type": "text", "x": 760, "y": 38, "width": 350, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "10.1.0.0/16 \u2192 local", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "10.1.0.0/16 \u2192 local", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 66345, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 42976, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "1d28e8535eb45c72", "type": "text", "x": 760, "y": 55, "width": 350, "height": 18, "strokeColor": "#34D399", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "10.0.0.0/16 \u2192 pcx-abc123  \u2190 PEERING ROUTE!", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "10.0.0.0/16 \u2192 pcx-abc123  \u2190 PEERING ROUTE!", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 81000, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 56865, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5fc530e402d60855", "type": "text", "x": 140, "y": 110, "width": 1340, "height": 100, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "HOW IT WORKS:  App-1 (10.0.1.5) wants to talk to Web-1 (10.1.1.10)\n\u2460 App-1 sends packet \u2192 Route Table A says '10.1.0.0/16 \u2192 peering connection pcx-abc123'\n\u2461 Packet travels through the peering tunnel (private, no internet, on AWS backbone network)\n\u2462 Arrives at VPC-B \u2192 Route Table B delivers to Web-1 in the private subnet\n\nIMPORTANT: Both sides MUST add a route. The peering is NOT automatic \u2014 you create it,\nthe other side ACCEPTS it, and BOTH sides add routes. CIDRs must NOT overlap!", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HOW IT WORKS:  App-1 (10.0.1.5) wants to talk to Web-1 (10.1.1.10)\n\u2460 App-1 sends packet \u2192 Route Table A says '10.1.0.0/16 \u2192 peering connection pcx-abc123'\n\u2461 Packet travels through the peering tunnel (private, no internet, on AWS backbone network)\n\u2462 Arrives at VPC-B \u2192 Route Table B delivers to Web-1 in the private subnet\n\nIMPORTANT: Both sides MUST add a route. The peering is NOT automatic \u2014 you create it,\nthe other side ACCEPTS it, and BOTH sides add routes. CIDRs must NOT overlap!", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 31383, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 24353, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b8638fdbbbae9ec4", "type": "text", "x": 140, "y": 225, "width": 1340, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "THE PROBLEM: Peering is 1-to-1 and NOT transitive. If A\u2194B and B\u2194C, A cannot talk to C!\n3 VPCs = 3 peerings, 10 VPCs = 45 peerings, 50 VPCs = 1,225 peerings!! This doesn't scale.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "THE PROBLEM: Peering is 1-to-1 and NOT transitive. If A\u2194B and B\u2194C, A cannot talk to C!\n3 VPCs = 3 peerings, 10 VPCs = 45 peerings, 50 VPCs = 1,225 peerings!! This doesn't scale.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 61857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 63598, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a97c334fe5c68d50", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1890, "y": 415, "width": 220, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "#78350F", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 26383, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 38148, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "3dd5165f6cd4a10d", "type": "image", "x": 1900, "y": 432, "width": 36, "height": 36, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "fileId": "c60f87adc5b07b06b96fbe566d55c1170fb89594", "scale": [1, 1], "status": "saved", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 54324, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 35484, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "43913452ad7eff4f", "type": "text", "x": 1942, "y": 425, "width": 155, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Transit Gateway\n(TGW)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Transit Gateway\n(TGW)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 36909, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 52218, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "85c67296eb5c3c9b", "type": "arrow", "x": 1460, "y": 1020, "width": 431, "height": 536, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "points": [[0, 0], [36, -190], [97, -362], [357, -372], [430, -535]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "angle": 0, "roughness": 2, "opacity": 100, "seed": 98505, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48980, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e8291e966886550d", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1550, "y": -250, "width": 1500, "height": 620, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "#111827", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 37234, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 57170, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "1be848864252d118", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1550, "y": -250, "width": 1500, "height": 34, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "#F59E0B", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 20171, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 98569, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a66ead87801aede5", "type": "text", "x": 1562, "y": -243, "width": 1476, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Transit Gateway \u2014 One Hub to Connect EVERYTHING", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Transit Gateway \u2014 One Hub to Connect EVERYTHING", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 67084, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 60093, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "3298a9ca0f21a96e", "type": "arrow", "x": 2110, "y": 450, "width": 561, "height": 391, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "points": [[0, 0], [-191, -23], [-365, -71], [-394, -329], [-560, -390]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "angle": 0, "roughness": 2, "opacity": 100, "seed": 20806, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 32280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "0294a30aed85413d", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": -200, "width": 1460, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#CBD5E1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Think of Transit Gateway like a central train station. Instead of building roads between\nevery city (VPC peering mesh), every city connects to ONE station. Talk to any city through it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Think of Transit Gateway like a central train station. Instead of building roads between\nevery city (VPC peering mesh), every city connects to ONE station. Talk to any city through it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 46576, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 99080, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "46c5195befd8dba3", "type": "ellipse", "x": 2120, "y": -95, "width": 100, "height": 100, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "#78350F", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 19108, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 81507, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "433a1f78a072641f", "type": "image", "x": 2145, "y": -80, "width": 50, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "fileId": "c60f87adc5b07b06b96fbe566d55c1170fb89594", "scale": [1, 1], "status": "saved", "angle": 0, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 78569, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 64206, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6330361287491249", "type": "text", "x": 2135, "y": -26, "width": 