 false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "78c4b2eb4875a292", "type": "arrow", "x": 2240, "y": 55, "width": 71, "height": 51, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "points": [[0, 0], [-24, -3], [-46, -9], [-49, -42], [-70, -50]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "angle": 0, "roughness": 2, "opacity": 100, "seed": 91000, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 19764, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "2b5daa21d04e3852", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 135, "width": 1460, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "HOW IT WORKS:  VPC-A wants to reach VPC-C (Shared Services):\n\u2460 VPC-A route table: 10.2.0.0/16 \u2192 tgw-xxx (send to Transit Gateway)\n\u2461 TGW route table: 10.2.0.0/16 \u2192 VPC-C attachment (route to VPC-C)\n\u2462 Packet delivered to VPC-C. Done! ALL traffic goes through ONE central hub.", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HOW IT WORKS:  VPC-A wants to reach VPC-C (Shared Services):\n\u2460 VPC-A route table: 10.2.0.0/16 \u2192 tgw-xxx (send to Transit Gateway)\n\u2461 TGW route table: 10.2.0.0/16 \u2192 VPC-C attachment (route to VPC-C)\n\u2462 Packet delivered to VPC-C. Done! ALL traffic goes through ONE central hub.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 28738, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 32781, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "523d5d3b35c2ed42", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 225, "width": 1460, "height": 20, "strokeColor": "#FBBF24", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "WHY TRANSIT GATEWAY?", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHY TRANSIT GATEWAY?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 51215, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 65083, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "fac12f9944fdec0d", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 250, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Transitive routing \u2014 VPC-A \u2194 TGW \u2194 VPC-B. Any VPC can talk to any other via the hub!", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Transitive routing \u2014 VPC-A \u2194 TGW \u2194 VPC-B. Any VPC can talk to any other via the hub!", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 24918, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 81103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "14317d4a3721588c", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 274, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 One connection per VPC \u2014 instead of N peering connections, each VPC connects once to TGW", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 One connection per VPC \u2014 instead of N peering connections, each VPC connects once to TGW", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 37700, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 68244, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "672f6a721e218f09", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 298, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Hybrid: VPN + Direct Connect plug into TGW \u2014 on-prem can reach ALL VPCs through one connection", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Hybrid: VPN + Direct Connect plug into TGW \u2014 on-prem can reach ALL VPCs through one connection", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 44985, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 35972, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5d931250ecf89d8e", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 322, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Network segmentation \u2014 separate route tables: Prod can't reach Dev, but both reach Shared Services", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Network segmentation \u2014 separate route tables: Prod can't reach Dev, but both reach Shared Services", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 30272, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 11679, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "8d777b9162de5dc3", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 346, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Up to 5,000 VPC attachments \u2014 scales to massive enterprise networks", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Up to 5,000 VPC attachments \u2014 scales to massive enterprise networks", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 22018, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 45360, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "fef8f43ae3f293e5", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 370, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Cross-account: share TGW with other AWS accounts via AWS RAM (Resource Access Manager)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Cross-account: share TGW with other AWS accounts via AWS RAM (Resource Access Manager)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 86264, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 50403, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "8d19a6f5efcead4e", "type": "text", "x": 1570, "y": 394, "width": 1460, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2022 Cost: $0.05/hr per attachment ($36/mo) + $0.02/GB \u2014 more expensive than peering but MUCH simpler", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Cost: $0.05/hr per attachment ($36/mo) + $0.02/GB \u2014 more expensive than peering but MUCH simpler", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 49903, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 97903, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "84a460d1e482c81f", "type": "rectangle", "x": 500, "y": 1465, "width": 200, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "#7F1D1D", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 65585, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 97546, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "9428f1378ab54bbf", "type": "image", "x": 510, "y": 1482, "width": 36, "height": 36, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backg