physical fiber cable (cross-connect) links your router to the AWS DX port\n\u2462 You create Virtual Interfaces (VIFs) on the DX port:\n   \u2022 Private VIF \u2192 connects to 1 VPC via Virtual Private Gateway\n   \u2022 Transit VIF \u2192 connects to Transit Gateway \u2192 reach ALL your VPCs!\n\u2463 Traffic flows on dedicated fiber \u2014 never touches the public internet\n\nSpeed: 1, 10, or 100 Gbps (dedicated) or 50 Mbps\u201310 Gbps (hosted via partner)\nLatency: Consistent and predictable (unlike VPN which varies with internet)\nSetup: 2-4 weeks (need physical cable installation)\nCost: ~$0.30/hr (1Gbps port) + $0.02/GB data \u2014 expensive but unbeatable performance\n\nBEST PRACTICE: Use Direct Connect as primary + Site-to-Site VPN as backup (if DX fails)", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HOW IT WORKS:\n\u2460 Your data center's router connects to a colocation facility (Equinix, CoreSite, etc.)\n\u2461 A physical fiber cable (cross-connect) links your router to the AWS DX port\n\u2462 You create Virtual Interfaces (VIFs) on the DX port:\n   \u2022 Private VIF \u2192 connects to 1 VPC via Virtual Private Gateway\n   \u2022 Transit VIF \u2192 connects to Transit Gateway \u2192 reach ALL your VPCs!\n\u2463 Traffic flows on dedicated fiber \u2014 never touches the public internet\n\nSpeed: 1, 10, or 100 Gbps (dedicated) or 50 Mbps\u201310 Gbps (hosted via partner)\nLatency: Consistent and predictable (unlike VPN which varies with internet)\nSetup: 2-4 weeks (need physical cable installation)\nCost: ~$0.30/hr (1Gbps port) + $0.02/GB data \u2014 expensive but unbeatable performance\n\nBEST PRACTICE: Use Direct Connect as primary + Site-to-Site VPN as backup (if DX fails)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 29517, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 69122, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4c9d9d68658c25b1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 250, "y": 1065, "width": 200, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "#7F1D1D", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 32916, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 72106, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b0df8520b4ff22dd", "type": "text", "x": 260, "y": 1075, "width": 180, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Peering vs TGW\nComparison", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Peering vs TGW\nComparison", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 29256, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 56178, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4cf19cc2ccba6b6c", "type": "arrow", "x": 1310, "y": 1100, "width": 861, "height": 1, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "points": [[0, 0], [-215, 113], [-430, 189], [-645, -56], [-860, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "angle": 0, "roughness": 2, "opacity": 100, "seed": 95982, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 26170, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "503dab359837acc7", "type": "rectangle", "x": -350, "y": 750, "width": 650, "height": 550, "strokeColor": "#EF4444", "backgroundColor": "#111827", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 16897, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 18404, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "